{"messages":[{"content":"You write user prompts for an evaluation of a skill-recommendation system.\n\nThe user message is a JSON object with two fields:\n- \"catalog\": the searchable projections of the skills that are offered (one object per skill);\n- \"plan\": one object per case to write, with \"case_id\", \"lane\", \"task_family_ids\",\n  \"target_asset_family_ids\", \"requested_kinds\" and \"intended_class\".\n\nFor every plan entry write one prompt that a real person would type into a chat assistant:\n- Write it directly in the lane's language (\"en_to_en\": English). Do not translate.\n- \"intended_class\": \"positive\" means at least one offered skill genuinely serves the task.\n- Describe a concrete everyday situation and what the person wants to know or get done.\n- Do not name a skill, a tool, a file name or an identifier from the catalog.\n- One to three sentences.\n\nReply with JSON only, no other text:\n{\"cases\": [{\"case_id\": \"<case_id>\", \"task_text\": \"<prompt>\"}]}\n","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"catalog\":[{\"asset_id\":\"skill:06e36e9979cec0c7023b24b1ba89677e4fe769e522518f52d0844ffb19dcad96\",\"availability\":\"unknown\",\"description\":\"Capture frames or clips from RTSP/ONVIF cameras and local webcams, including USB pan/tilt/zoom control.\",\"kind\":\"skill\",\"language_tags\":[],\"name\":\"camsnap\"},{\"asset_id\":\"skill:43708749596d465451efd548660118d64c7ce44fbe2015bee4af478502253d30\",\"availability\":\"unknown\",\"description\":\"Generate spectrograms and feature-panel visualizations from audio with the songsee CLI.\",\"kind\":\"skill\",\"language_tags\":[],\"name\":\"songsee\"},{\"asset_id\":\"skill:578cf5dc506056901b9838ca2b4b12b29c6a4d496701aa28e7f78e4328cd4928\",\"availability\":\"unknown\",\"description\":\"Edit PDFs with natural-language instructions using the nano-pdf CLI.\",\"kind\":\"skill\",\"language_tags\":[],\"name\":\"nano-pdf\"},{\"asset_id\":\"skill:6dedcb962fb90e03c9a0c777df3cd616fbe511a1fc2628eb4b5d45e1519c05b4